<title>CANADA: SOCCER-CANADA BEAT COSTA RICA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFYING.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CANADA BEAT COSTA RICA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFYING.</headline>
<dateline>EMDONTON, Alberta 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada beat Costa</p>
<p>Rica 1-0 (0-0 halftime) in a CONCACAF World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Eddy Berdusco (68th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,150</p>
</text>
